  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 146d4770de626e347adb2af1fed31305, type: 3}
  m_Name: StartingTV Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  IsThoughts: 0
  DialogueLines:
  - ColorType: 9
    Text: So, going back to what you said about...
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: Wait, wait. Can I tell a quick story first?
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: "I promise I\u2019ll come back to it later, \nso I might as well get it
      out of the way now."
  - ColorType: 9
    Text: "Alright, let\u2019s hear it..."
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: Okay, so when I was a kid, I was a bit of a troubled child.
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: "My late mother used to tell me that somewhere \nout there lived this terrifying
      monster."
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: But it could only hurt me if I let it in.
  - ColorType: 9
    Text: "Um, I don\u2019t mean to be rude, but..."
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: Yeah, I know. My mother was a rather... peculiar woman.
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: As a kid, I had no idea what she meant.
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: "But now, as a grown man, I\u2019m more afraid \nof that monster than ever
      before."
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: "And that\u2019s my warning to all of you watching at home."
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: Remember to never let it in.
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: Now, let me explain how this ties into our main topic...
